NewsClaw DSH Plugin

This project is a news-domain derivative of the OpenBiliClaw DSH Plugin and
OpenBiliClaw. The derivative keeps the original user-interface structure and
agent-bridge design while replacing video-platform semantics with local news
recommendation semantics.

